{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:NuclearInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull","@type":"LeanModule","name":"NuclearInteractions.SilverRatioBetaDecayNull","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.hoefsmit_b_squared_at_silver_ratio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.hoefsmit_b_squared_at_silver_ratio","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/silver-ratio-beta-decay-null.lean#L73-L115","doc":"**At silver ratio, b² (Hoefsmit coupling squared) = 7/8 exactly.**\n\nDerivation: at q = 1 + √2, q² = 3 + 2√2, q⁴ = 17 + 12√2.\nNumerator q⁴ + q² + 1 = 21 + 14√2 = 7(3 + 2√2).\nDenominator (q² + 1)² = (4 + 2√2)² = 16 + 16√2 + 8 = 24 + 16√2 = 8(3 + 2√2).\nRatio: 7/8. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.hecke_quadratic_silver_ratio_self_referential","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.hecke_quadratic_silver_ratio_self_referential","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/silver-ratio-beta-decay-null.lean#L55-L71","doc":"**Self-referential fixed point**: at q = 1 + √2 (silver ratio),\nthe Hecke quadratic σ² = h·σ + 1 becomes σ² = 2σ + 1, whose\nroots are σ = 1 ± √2 — equal to q^{±1} at the silver ratio. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.beta_decay_null_iff_h_zero_or_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.beta_decay_null_iff_h_zero_or_two","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/silver-ratio-beta-decay-null.lean#L40-L53","doc":"**β-decay null condition**: Δ(net) vanishes iff h = 0 or h = 2. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:silver-ratio-beta-decay-null","label":"prop:silver-ratio-beta-decay-null","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/silver-ratio-beta-decay-null.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.silver_ratio_polynomial_root","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.silver_ratio_polynomial_root","kind":"theorem","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/silver-ratio-beta-decay-null.lean#L29-L38","doc":"The silver ratio conjugates 1 ± √2 are roots of q² - 2q - 1 = 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.deltaNet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.deltaNet","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/silver-ratio-beta-decay-null.lean#L25-L27","doc":"Symbolic Δ(net) = h(h-2)/2 from `prop:neutron-qvalue-symbolic`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.heckeSkein","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.heckeSkein","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/silver-ratio-beta-decay-null.lean#L22-L23","doc":"Hecke skein parameter h = q - q⁻¹. ","signatureChunk":0}]}